Package: fastASSETcli
Type: Package
Title: Reference-Aligned FastASSET Command-Line Pipeline
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R: person("Jibin", "John", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "69025183+JIBINJOHNV@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Runs a reference-aligned fastASSET workflow for large collections
    of traits. It can load a separately saved GenomicSEM LDSC
    object or generate one from a validated summary-statistic manifest
    containing tabular or GWAS-VCF inputs. The manifest is the only
    summary-statistic input and is converted internally to the required
    multi-trait FastASSET table, using allele-encoded variant identifiers for
    VCF inputs while retaining original rsIDs for LDSC. The workflow restores and audits
    trait labels, reorders the intercept covariance matrix,
    normalizes it to a trait correlation matrix, performs directional fastASSET
    subset testing with the published closed-form handling for single-trait
    cases, writes fixed-effect Meta-compatible output, and records
    severity-ranked quality control.
